#: kcmsmserver.cpp:132
msgid ""
"<h1>Session Manager</h1> You can configure the session manager here. This "
"includes options such as whether or not the session exit (logout) should be "
"confirmed, whether the session should be restored again when logging in and "
"whether the computer should be automatically shut down after session exit by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Rheolydd Sesiynau</h1>Gallwch ffurfweddu'r rheolydd sesiynau yma. Mae "
"hwn yn cynnwys dewisiadau fel dylid cadarnhau allanfa (allgofnodi) y sesiwn "
"neu peidio, dylid adfer y sesiwn eto wrth fewngofnodi, a dylid cau'r "
"cyfrifiadur i lawr yn ymysgogol ar ôl allanfa'r sesiwn fel rhagosodiad."

#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Session Manager"
msgstr "Rheolydd Sesiynau"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "General"
msgstr "Cyffredinol"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "Conf&irm logout"
msgstr "Cadarn&hau allgofnodi"

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the session manager to display a logout "
"confirmation dialog box."
msgstr ""
"Llenwch y blwch cywiro yma os ydych eisiau i'r rheolydd sisiynau ddangos "
"ymgom cadarnhau allgofnodi."

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "On Login"
msgstr "Ar Fewngofnodi"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"<ul>\n"
"<li><b>Restore previous session:</b> Will save all applications running on "
"exit and restore them when they next start up</li>\n"
"<li><b>Restore manually saved session: </b> Allows the session to be saved "
"at any time via \"Save Session\" in the K-Menu. This means the currently "
"started applications will reappear when they next start up.</li>\n"
"<li><b>Start with an empty session:</b> Don't save anything. Will come up "
"with an empty desktop on next start.</li>\n"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<ul>\n"
"<li><b>Adfer y sesiwn cynt:</b> Wrth derfynnu, bydd yn cadw pob cymhwysiant "
"sy'n rhedeg, a'u adfer wrth iddynt ymgychwyn nesaf.</li>\n"
"<li><b>Adfer sesiwn wedi'i gadw â llaw: </b> Gadael i'r sesiwn gael ei "
"gadwunrhyw amser drwy \"Cadw Sesiwn\" yn y Ddewislen-K. Golyga hyn bydd y "
"cymhwysiadau sydd wedi'u cychwyn eisioes yn ail-ymddangos wrth iddynt "
"ymgychwyn nesaf.</li>\n"
"<li><b>Cychwyn efo sesiwn gwag:</b> Peidio â chadw. Bydd yn cynhyrchu "
"penbwrdd gwag wrth yr ymgychwyn nesaf.</li>\n"
"</ul>"

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "Restore &previous session"
msgstr "Adfer y sesiwn &cynt"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "Restore &manually saved session"
msgstr "Adfer sesiwn a &gadwyd â llaw."

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "Start with an &empty session"
msgstr "Cychwyn efo seseiwn g&wag"

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "Default Action After Logout"
msgstr "Gweithred Rhagosod ar Ôl Allgofnodi"

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid ""
"Here you can choose what should happen by default when you log out. This "
"only has meaning, if you logged in through KDM."
msgstr ""
"Dyma lle gallwch ddewis be ddylai ddigwydd wrth ragosod pan yn allgofnodi. "
"Nid yw ystyr gan hyn, os nad ydych wedi mewngofnodi drwy KDM."

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "&Login as different user"
msgstr "&Mewngofnodi fel defnyddiwr gwahanol"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "&Turn off computer"
msgstr "&Cau'r cyfrifiadur i lawr"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "&Restart computer"
msgstr "&Ail-gychwyn y cyfrifiadur"

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Uwch"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid "Applications to be excluded from sessions:"
msgstr "Cymhwysiadau i'w gwahardd o sesiynau"

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid ""
"Here you can enter a colon-separated list of applications that should not be "
"saved in sessions, and therefore won't be started when restoring a session. "
"For example 'xterm:xconsole'.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gallwch mewnosod yma rhestr o gymwysiadau, wedi'u wahanu gan gorwahannod, na "
"ddylid cael eu cadw mewn sesiynau, ac felly na ddechreuir wrth adfer sesiwn. "
"Er enghraifft 'xterm:xconsole'.\n"
